{"resourceIdentifier":"70","resourceName":"Irani Wastewater Methane Avoidance Project","description":"The Project is a wastewater methane avoidance project at a pulp and paper facility in Santa Catarina state, Brazil, owned by pulp and paper manufacturer Celulose Irani S.A.   Prior to the project activity, wastewater treatment consisted of primary treatment only in a series of ponds, with superficial aeration only in the first pond.   Except for the minimal and inefficient superficial aeration in the first pond, organic material degraded anaerobically in the facility’s lagoon system, producing significant amounts of methane.  The project activity consisted of implementation of a new wastewater treatment scheme using aerobic treatment, referred to as secondary or biologic treatment. The new wastewater treatment system uses highly aerated activated sludge, which is decanted and reused.  A significant environmental benefit of the project is that the removal of potentially harmful organic material allows for the treated wastewater to be directed to a nearby river.","location":{"latitude":-26.243897,"longitude":-49.508536},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"70"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Santa Catarina"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"EcoSecurities International Limited"},{"type":"string","value":"Netherlands"},{"type":"string","value":"+31 203011463"},{"type":"string","value":"info@33assetmngt.com"},{"type":"string","value":"www.33assetmngt.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"70"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"55966"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.I."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Det Norske Veritas Climate Change Services AS (DNV)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"06/04/2020"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3rd, 01/04/2021 - 31/03/2028"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=471&IDKEY=998klasmf8jflkasf8098afnasfkj98f0a9sfsakjflsakjf8d8649509","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"Irani wastewater PDD.pdf","uploadDate":"2009-06-11T13:12:27.1Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=470&IDKEY=n903q4jsafkasjfu90amnmasdfkaidflnmdf9348r09dmfasdfd648130","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"PPRR for Grandparenting.pdf","uploadDate":"2009-06-11T13:11:47.77Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=464&IDKEY=olksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098a639856","documentType":"Validation Report","documentName":"Validation Report CDM - Irani WW.pdf","uploadDate":"2009-06-11T13:03:57.093Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_ISSUANCE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Issuance Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=467&IDKEY=lq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhl643993","documentType":"Issuance Representation","documentName":"Issuance Deed of Representation - Irani Wastewater Methane Avoidance Project.pdf","uploadDate":"2009-06-11T13:07:19.237Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=466&IDKEY=j0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9f6